WEBVTT

00:21.020 --> 00:24.180
Sorry it turned out to be like this, Tohru.

00:24.320 --> 00:26.020
Don't worry about it, uncle.

00:27.290 --> 00:30.380
I was planning to go to that school in the first place.

00:30.590 --> 00:31.360
But...

00:31.790 --> 00:34.060
When I'm gone...

00:34.830 --> 00:36.300
I'm sure that...

00:38.430 --> 00:40.330
Well, I have to get going.

00:51.110 --> 00:52.450
So this is it...

01:01.490 --> 01:04.430
I can't be late on my first day. I have to hurry.

01:16.340 --> 01:18.570
A girl?

01:28.280 --> 01:34.810
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

01:35.090 --> 01:41.590
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

01:42.530 --> 01:47.560
<i>I know what I want to</i> <i>say to you every time.</i>

01:47.700 --> 01:54.340
<i>I always have it</i> <i>hidden inside my heart.</i>

01:55.340 --> 02:00.080
<i>I know it's an important feeling...</i>

02:00.250 --> 02:05.650
<i>...and I'm keeping it warm</i> <i>to give it to you someday.</i>

02:07.890 --> 02:13.620
<i>The sound of the bells</i>
<i>I hear from far away...</i>

02:13.730 --> 02:20.530
<i>...makes my heart beat faster and</i> <i>cuts through the sky like a wind.</i>

02:20.670 --> 02:27.370
<i>After I met you, you shed</i> <i>some light onto my heart.</i>

02:27.480 --> 02:33.210
<i>I spent my days doing the</i> <i>same things all the time.</i>

02:33.420 --> 02:39.910
<i>And when it's time to tell you</i> <i>the things I've been wanting to say.</i>

02:40.220 --> 02:45.790
<i>You're my sunshine, an eternal smile!</i>

02:46.230 --> 02:56.230
<i>Our prologue, to this exciting story...</i>

02:58.310 --> 03:03.870
<i>Princess of the Boy's School</i>

03:41.880 --> 03:43.610
No, it's not what you think!

03:43.690 --> 03:45.550
Princess! Where are you?

03:46.290 --> 03:47.420
Princess!

03:47.960 --> 03:49.620
Where are you, Princess?

03:50.560 --> 03:51.650
Princess!

04:06.680 --> 04:08.340
All men in black...

04:08.640 --> 04:09.670
Yuck!

04:10.010 --> 04:12.980
It's a boy's school all right.

04:13.250 --> 04:15.310
Not even a glimpse of something feminine.

04:16.720 --> 04:17.740
But...

04:18.390 --> 04:20.480
I wonder who that was...

04:20.560 --> 04:22.920
One of the students here...

04:23.020 --> 04:24.790
No, it can't be.

04:25.760 --> 04:27.660
I'll tell you one thing.

04:27.800 --> 04:30.960
You should've been here from the very beginning.

04:31.030 --> 04:34.760
It would've saved you the trouble of transferring at this time of year.

04:34.870 --> 04:35.600
Right...

04:35.900 --> 04:38.930
The orientation is already finished by now...

04:39.040 --> 04:41.700
...so it's going to be hard for you to get used to this place.

04:44.880 --> 04:46.470
What is it?

04:46.580 --> 04:48.520
You're good-looking Kouno.

04:48.650 --> 04:49.710
Excuse me?

04:49.820 --> 04:52.310
You were probably popular before you transferred here, right?

04:52.390 --> 04:53.720
Teacher?

04:54.290 --> 04:56.320
You have nothing to worry about.

04:56.390 --> 04:59.990
They'll welcome you with open arms. You'll get used to this place in no time.

05:00.400 --> 05:01.450
What?

05:01.900 --> 05:04.990
I'm sure that would apply to a girl, but I'm a guy.

05:05.500 --> 05:08.030
They won't welcome me with open arms.

05:09.040 --> 05:10.470
Kouno.

05:10.670 --> 05:13.440
You shouldn't expect this place to make sense.

05:13.540 --> 05:15.770
This is a boy's school.

05:22.920 --> 05:26.550
I'd like to introduce a new transfer student.

05:26.620 --> 05:27.820
Come in Kouno.

05:35.930 --> 05:37.460
Quiet!

05:37.770 --> 05:40.740
He had to transfer here due to family matters.

05:41.370 --> 05:46.070
<i>Tohru Kouno</i>

05:46.510 --> 05:48.100
Be nice to him.

05:48.380 --> 05:49.870
I'm Tohru Kouno.

05:50.050 --> 05:52.510
I want to get used to this place real soon.

05:52.780 --> 05:53.770
Nice to meet you all.

05:55.380 --> 05:58.620
This place is really full of guys.

05:58.820 --> 06:00.690
Jam-packed with guys.

06:03.120 --> 06:05.120
Plus, it's just what the teacher said.

06:05.390 --> 06:07.360
They're really happy to see me.

06:08.100 --> 06:11.000
What is this strange feeling of joy around them?

06:11.430 --> 06:12.920
Hey Sakamoto!

06:13.500 --> 06:14.430
Yes.

06:14.540 --> 06:17.370
This is Sakamoto, he's the class representative.

06:17.440 --> 06:19.530
Sakamoto, take good care of Kouno.

06:19.640 --> 06:20.370
Yes!

06:22.180 --> 06:24.940
He seems like a reliable person.

06:26.750 --> 06:27.980
Hey, are you sure about this?

06:28.080 --> 06:30.610
What about the older students?

06:31.690 --> 06:33.520
What's going on?

06:33.620 --> 06:34.850
This feeling of anxiety...

06:35.090 --> 06:36.620
Be quiet!

06:36.730 --> 06:39.790
You're making Kouno feel uncomfortable like that.

06:41.060 --> 06:44.760
I'm already feeling uncomfortable!

06:45.530 --> 06:49.630
Anyway, I'm sure Sakamoto is going to take good care of you.

06:49.740 --> 06:52.900
Now go grab a vacant seat in the back.

06:53.010 --> 06:53.700
Yes.

07:02.980 --> 07:05.010
I'm Shihoudani, nice to meet you.

07:05.120 --> 07:06.180
What the...

07:12.930 --> 07:13.660
What?

07:13.960 --> 07:15.450
Sitting next to me is...

07:15.530 --> 07:16.460
...a girl?

07:19.530 --> 07:20.430
No way!

07:20.500 --> 07:21.830
This is a boy's school!

07:21.900 --> 07:24.460
He's wearing a boy's school uniform!

07:25.510 --> 07:28.440
Umm, nice to meet you...

07:29.240 --> 07:31.580
I didn't know there were any...

07:31.880 --> 07:35.180
Guys that look like girls, that is.

07:35.550 --> 07:37.180
Oh, Shihoudani!

07:37.590 --> 07:39.650
Kouno will be new to the dorm.

07:39.890 --> 07:42.480
Can you look after him?

07:42.590 --> 07:43.180
Yes.

07:43.560 --> 07:46.530
I mean, take a look at Kouno.

07:46.660 --> 07:48.890
I'm sure his room will be near yours.

07:49.200 --> 07:50.190
You're right.

07:50.500 --> 07:51.660
Huh? What?

08:01.780 --> 08:04.710
What the heck is this?

08:07.050 --> 08:08.710
Hey Yujirou, what's for lunch?

08:08.820 --> 08:10.580
Come eat with us, Shihoudani.

08:10.720 --> 08:11.810
Sure.

08:14.120 --> 08:15.750
Amazing.

08:15.860 --> 08:18.160
They always do that during every break.

08:18.560 --> 08:21.790
They're like ardent fans surrounding a pop idol.

08:21.930 --> 08:22.900
Kouno?

08:23.670 --> 08:25.100
Oh, Sakamoto.

08:25.230 --> 08:27.260
It's lunchtime but what are you going to do?

08:27.570 --> 08:30.870
If you brought lunch, then I can show you around the school after you eat.

08:31.070 --> 08:34.040
If not, I'll show you the school cafeteria and how you can purchase food.

08:34.140 --> 08:36.580
Oh, I didn't bring anything.

08:37.050 --> 08:39.110
Okay, then let's go.

08:44.820 --> 08:46.850
This is the regular school building.

08:47.020 --> 08:48.920
It's separated by different grades on each floor.

08:49.020 --> 08:49.720
Okay.

08:49.960 --> 08:52.220
Across the lobby on the other side is the special building.

08:54.200 --> 08:57.260
They have language labs and rooms for electives.

08:57.770 --> 09:00.000
But I'll teach you that when we get there later.

09:00.600 --> 09:01.570
Why...

09:01.840 --> 09:05.100
I showed you bathrooms this morning, so you know where they are, right?

09:05.310 --> 09:06.640
They're located next to the staircase.

09:06.940 --> 09:10.040
Why is everyone making a slight bow to Sakamoto?

09:10.810 --> 09:13.810
And inside this lobby is where you can buy food.

09:14.350 --> 09:16.580
The cafeteria is located upstairs, but...

09:16.680 --> 09:17.740
Where do you want to eat?

09:17.820 --> 09:19.520
Let's just eat here.

09:19.620 --> 09:20.520
Mr. Sakamoto!

09:21.060 --> 09:22.120
Mr. Sakamoto?

09:22.620 --> 09:24.060
You're eating bread for lunch?

09:24.160 --> 09:25.250
That's a surprise.

09:25.330 --> 09:27.850
No, I'm eating with a friend, so...

09:28.160 --> 09:30.720
Hey! He's a year older than us.

09:31.670 --> 09:35.760
Why is an upperclassman speaking to Sakamoto in a polite manner?

09:36.870 --> 09:38.340
Yes, thank you very much.

09:38.610 --> 09:39.270
Mr. Sakamoto.

09:39.340 --> 09:40.970
Mr. Sakamoto came to buy food?

09:41.080 --> 09:42.770
Hello, Mr. Sakamoto.

09:52.690 --> 09:54.120
Mr. Sakamoto.

09:54.760 --> 09:56.750
Please sit here, Mr. Sakamoto.

09:56.860 --> 09:57.990
Thank you very much.

09:58.360 --> 09:59.330
Kouno.

09:59.660 --> 10:02.190
You should eat quickly, lunch break will be over soon.

10:02.300 --> 10:06.740
This school is a bit odd, don't you think?

10:06.840 --> 10:08.740
Well, sort of...

10:09.040 --> 10:11.100
It's like being in another dimension.

10:11.310 --> 10:12.740
Another dimension?

10:14.210 --> 10:17.370
Kouno, this is outer space.

10:17.680 --> 10:18.840
W-What? Oh...

10:20.820 --> 10:22.080
Then how about this?

10:25.920 --> 10:29.980
I have a feeling I came to a terrible place...

10:36.230 --> 10:38.630
I'll take you to the dorm.

10:38.830 --> 10:41.030
Thanks Shihoudani.

10:41.100 --> 10:41.830
Sure.

10:41.900 --> 10:44.030
Well, see you tomorrow Kouno.

10:44.110 --> 10:45.230
Okay, bye.

11:00.890 --> 11:05.050
I don't really know what
Shihoudani is thinking.

11:05.160 --> 11:07.030
He's hard for me to deal with.

11:08.000 --> 11:10.060
You're moving your things in today?

11:10.330 --> 11:13.770
Usually you move into the dorm and then go to class.

11:14.270 --> 11:15.400
Yeah...

11:15.740 --> 11:17.400
I moved here at the last minute so...

11:18.410 --> 11:19.900
I see...

11:32.420 --> 11:33.910
That's the dorm.

11:49.470 --> 11:54.430
<i>Fujimori Dormitory</i>

11:54.910 --> 11:56.400
Your shoes go here.

11:57.080 --> 11:59.170
Looks like they don't have your name plate.

11:59.710 --> 12:01.180
We'll ask them to make it later.

12:01.480 --> 12:03.750
I wonder if Tsuji is back.

12:04.490 --> 12:05.680
Tsuji!

12:05.750 --> 12:07.280
Oh, Yujirou.

12:07.820 --> 12:09.220
So he's Kouno?

12:09.320 --> 12:10.120
Yes.

12:10.190 --> 12:12.390
I'm Tsuji, and I'm the one in charge here.

12:12.490 --> 12:14.460
Let me know if you need anything.

12:14.530 --> 12:15.860
I'm Kouno.

12:16.000 --> 12:17.330
Nice to meet you.

12:17.430 --> 12:19.400
Now about the room...

12:19.500 --> 12:21.900
This one is going to the P-ROOM, right?

12:22.170 --> 12:23.260
Yeah.

12:24.010 --> 12:27.200
This one is definitely going to the P-ROOM.

12:31.510 --> 12:34.810
I don't mind Kouno having a single room to himself, but...

12:35.020 --> 12:38.320
I think someone should stay with him until he gets used to "it."

12:38.390 --> 12:39.950
So...

12:40.190 --> 12:43.250
Either you or Mikoto have to move...

12:43.360 --> 12:45.730
I don't mind.

12:45.830 --> 12:47.460
I guess I'll go tell Mikoto.

12:48.830 --> 12:50.730
What is this "it" he mentioned?

12:51.130 --> 12:53.160
And what's a P-ROOM?

13:00.880 --> 13:03.000
Mikoto, do you have a minute?

13:03.080 --> 13:04.200
Yes.

13:24.130 --> 13:25.100
What?

13:25.300 --> 13:27.330
You were the girl wearing a skirt!

13:27.400 --> 13:29.930
You were one of the students here?

13:30.070 --> 13:32.940
This school has girls, too?

13:33.070 --> 13:34.510
Of course not!

13:34.580 --> 13:36.770
I'm really a guy!

13:36.880 --> 13:38.310
But this morning you were...

13:38.410 --> 13:40.040
Oh, I get it.

13:40.250 --> 13:42.340
He saw you doing "it", Mikoto.

13:46.120 --> 13:48.950
<i>Lounge</i>

13:49.060 --> 13:53.260
<i>Do Not Enter</i>

13:53.360 --> 13:56.530
Now we can talk privately.

13:57.230 --> 14:01.070
You have no idea what's going on right, Kouno?

14:01.140 --> 14:03.970
No, I haven't got a clue.

14:05.010 --> 14:09.000
You saw Mikoto dressed up this morning, but he's not doing it for fun.

14:09.110 --> 14:10.410
Then why?

14:11.110 --> 14:12.080
It's his job.

14:12.450 --> 14:13.850
Job?

14:13.920 --> 14:15.980
This school is full of guys, right?

14:16.420 --> 14:20.350
We need to add some excitement.

14:20.460 --> 14:24.590
So we look for some lovely boys to provide us with excitement.

14:24.860 --> 14:28.960
We pick out the boys and have them dress up like girls at times.

14:30.030 --> 14:34.940
And the ones who were picked this time were Yujirou and Mikoto.

14:35.300 --> 14:38.900
They attend different buildings to the east and west...

14:38.970 --> 14:41.440
...so they're known as the Princess of the West and the Princess of the East.

14:42.680 --> 14:43.610
Princess!

14:43.880 --> 14:46.140
Where are you, Princess?

14:49.650 --> 14:51.140
Princess...

14:51.450 --> 14:54.290
But I don't enjoy doing this kind of thing!

14:54.360 --> 14:56.150
They're making me do this!

14:56.260 --> 14:58.190
If you really hate it that much, then don't do it.

14:58.290 --> 15:00.420
I can't do that either!

15:00.600 --> 15:04.360
The school's in on it, so they'll flunk me if I don't do it!

15:04.500 --> 15:06.300
What? The school too?

15:06.400 --> 15:08.170
This is too despotic!

15:08.270 --> 15:10.570
They really flunk you for refusing to dress like a girl?

15:12.710 --> 15:14.400
This school...

15:14.510 --> 15:17.170
It's not a poor school now, is it?

15:17.280 --> 15:20.610
I don't mean to brag, but we're one of the best around this area.

15:20.720 --> 15:23.950
We're indeed one of the elite schools.

15:24.020 --> 15:27.150
But we can get away with things like this?

15:27.220 --> 15:29.590
Well, it's a boy's school.

15:29.690 --> 15:30.990
You can't help it.

15:31.090 --> 15:33.890
Even though we're among the elite, we're still human, we're still men...

15:35.530 --> 15:37.260
Can I say something?

15:39.000 --> 15:40.660
This school is weird.

15:42.370 --> 15:45.400
I'll try not to get involved in your affairs.

15:45.510 --> 15:48.030
What are you talking about, Kouno?

15:48.310 --> 15:51.340
Why do you think you're staying in the P-ROOM?

15:51.450 --> 15:52.140
What?

15:53.380 --> 15:56.350
The Princess Room, also known as the P-ROOM.

15:56.480 --> 15:58.180
In order to protect the princesses...

15:58.250 --> 16:00.980
...regular students are not allowed to enter this room.

16:01.160 --> 16:03.350
Since you were given this room...

16:03.560 --> 16:07.120
...there's a chance that you'll be chosen to be a princess as well.

16:07.230 --> 16:08.200
No!

16:08.360 --> 16:09.560
You're kidding, right?

16:14.970 --> 16:18.460
Well, you'll get the feel for it tomorrow at school.

16:18.640 --> 16:23.100
At any rate, you walked around the school with Mr. Sakamoto...

16:23.210 --> 16:25.080
...who is like a walking billboard.

16:25.210 --> 16:30.020
I'm sure they already know who you are by now.

16:48.040 --> 16:50.000
It's unbelievable, isn't it?

16:50.140 --> 16:52.110
Shihoudani told me all about it.

16:52.270 --> 16:54.500
You had something to do with this too, right Sakamoto?

16:54.610 --> 16:55.470
What?

16:56.110 --> 16:57.080
I'm sorry.

16:58.750 --> 17:00.650
By the way, where's Shihoudani?

17:00.780 --> 17:02.550
I thought you were with him.

17:02.620 --> 17:05.140
He left early since he had to take care of something.

17:05.250 --> 17:07.420
Ah, it must be that.

17:07.490 --> 17:08.620
What's that?

17:08.760 --> 17:09.750
Look.

17:24.510 --> 17:26.440
Hey Kouno.

17:26.510 --> 17:28.070
Good morning to you too Mr. Sakamoto.

17:28.710 --> 17:29.610
Good morning.

17:29.680 --> 17:31.610
Your outfit...

17:31.710 --> 17:33.580
You mean this?

17:33.850 --> 17:35.710
I was just doing my job.

17:36.150 --> 17:37.780
Our school team has a game pretty soon...

17:37.850 --> 17:40.080
...so I was just encouraging them by attending morning practice.

17:40.220 --> 17:43.190
You met Mikoto yesterday when he was working, right?

17:43.290 --> 17:46.730
But it looks like he tried to get away.

17:47.360 --> 17:50.260
There's something wrong with you if you're enjoying this...

17:50.770 --> 17:51.820
Shihoudani!

17:52.470 --> 17:56.100
In order to survive this dark world known as school life...

17:56.200 --> 18:00.200
...give this miserable servant some hope to get through the day.

18:00.310 --> 18:01.140
Yes, me too.

18:01.240 --> 18:01.800
Me too!

18:02.340 --> 18:03.440
Sure.

18:04.550 --> 18:07.450
Good morning everyone.

18:07.580 --> 18:10.380
Let's all have a wonderful day.

18:11.290 --> 18:12.380
Smile of an angel!

18:12.520 --> 18:15.350
I'll use my memory of her to create enough energy to get through the day!

18:15.720 --> 18:17.210
Wait a minute...

18:17.790 --> 18:21.130
Is this what I have to do if I become a princess?

18:21.360 --> 18:24.420
No, not necessarily.

18:24.530 --> 18:27.470
I'm just eager to provide them with service.

18:27.540 --> 18:31.400
When they ask me to do something, I just have to do it.

18:33.340 --> 18:34.500
No.

18:35.110 --> 18:37.270
I don't want to do this.

18:37.380 --> 18:38.710
Help me, Sakamoto.

18:38.810 --> 18:41.870
Don't worry, you're not a princess yet.

18:42.550 --> 18:44.420
Plus if you really don't want to do it...

18:44.520 --> 18:47.420
...then I'll think of something so you don't have to.

18:47.520 --> 18:48.420
Sakamoto!

18:49.890 --> 18:53.830
When I look at your face, I feel like
I'm free of all this strangeness...

18:53.890 --> 18:56.230
...and I kind of feel calm right now...

18:56.630 --> 19:00.530
It's like I feel blessed from the smile of Buddha...

19:00.840 --> 19:02.240
Hey!

19:02.370 --> 19:06.170
Didn't I just provide my angelic smile?

19:06.270 --> 19:08.370
Weren't you satisfied with my smile?

19:08.640 --> 19:09.870
I wasn't satisfied!

19:10.340 --> 19:14.510
Sakamoto, give me that power of healing.

19:14.620 --> 19:15.380
Kouno?

19:15.720 --> 19:16.840
He hugged Mr. Sakamoto.

19:16.920 --> 19:18.180
Hugged Mr. Sakamoto...

19:18.250 --> 19:19.620
Is that allowed?

19:19.850 --> 19:20.820
That's right!

19:20.920 --> 19:23.360
Sakamoto might have some secrets too...

19:24.790 --> 19:26.890
Anyway, I'm going to change.

19:26.960 --> 19:29.560
Better hurry, you'll be late for class.

19:29.630 --> 19:30.460
Yeah.

19:31.800 --> 19:33.500
Our princess is leaving.

19:33.600 --> 19:35.930
Why can't he stay dressed like that?

19:36.270 --> 19:38.430
What's all this commotion?

19:41.440 --> 19:44.380
Plus, how long is this going to last?

19:44.510 --> 19:45.880
So annoying...

19:46.510 --> 19:48.850
If you're going to decide, then do it quickly...

19:48.980 --> 19:51.580
We'll know in several days at the earliest.

19:51.720 --> 19:54.520
I have to wait until then?

19:59.230 --> 20:01.160
I'm sorry for disturbing you during your lunch break.

20:01.300 --> 20:02.760
You're Tohru Kouno, right?

20:02.930 --> 20:04.260
Ah, yes.

20:04.800 --> 20:08.170
We need to talk about your job in private.

20:08.270 --> 20:10.760
Please come to the student association room after school.

20:10.870 --> 20:12.430
Um, yes...

20:12.510 --> 20:14.870
You too, Shihoudani.

20:14.980 --> 20:15.600
Yes.

20:15.710 --> 20:17.200
Well, good bye.

20:22.250 --> 20:24.450
I can't believe they came so soon.

20:24.550 --> 20:26.780
I'll be happy if I can settle this matter.

20:28.660 --> 20:31.460
Is there any way I can say no to this princess thing?

20:31.990 --> 20:33.390
No way!

20:33.490 --> 20:35.790
I guess, you're probably right.

20:50.780 --> 20:52.940
I guess they called you too, huh?

20:53.050 --> 20:53.840
Yeah...

20:55.050 --> 20:58.680
Maybe I shouldn't have come here...

21:01.860 --> 21:03.620
Okay, let's go!

21:03.990 --> 21:05.290
Excuse us.

21:07.530 --> 21:09.660
Welcome to the student association room.

21:10.400 --> 21:11.630
Princess of the West.

21:11.700 --> 21:12.960
Princess of the East.

21:16.670 --> 21:19.970
And our newest princess candidate...

21:20.070 --> 21:21.910
...Tohru Kouno.

21:22.410 --> 21:23.470
I see...

21:23.810 --> 21:27.040
I'm Arisada, head of the student association.

21:41.730 --> 21:49.360
<i>If you're sad and feeling</i> <i>down, then call out to me.</i>

21:49.470 --> 21:57.540
<i>I'll be in the area, so let</i> <i>me know what's bothering you.</i>

21:57.950 --> 22:05.410
<i>If you're all by yourself,</i> <i>then you'll forget how to smile.</i>

22:05.520 --> 22:13.090
<i>A smile is something you</i> <i>share with another person.</i>

22:13.360 --> 22:23.360
<i>Hey, the future you can see</i> <i>from the classroom window...</i>

22:23.540 --> 22:30.070
<i>...is getting larger after</i> <i>taking in the sunlight.</i>

22:30.540 --> 22:31.940
<i>Smile at me!</i>

22:32.080 --> 22:39.850
<i>A smile is what makes you feel energetic!</i>

22:39.950 --> 22:46.020
<i>I want to give some smiles to you...</i>

22:46.130 --> 22:48.100
<i>...right away.</i>

22:48.460 --> 22:58.460
<i>In order for you to lift</i> <i>your head up and start walking.</i>

23:05.050 --> 23:08.620
Next Episode, A Princess is Born

23:08.620 --> 23:09.140
Let's do it.
